        "recommendation": "DOM focus stays on the combobox while `aria-activedescendant` moves the highlight, so a sighted keyboard user sees which size Arrow keys reached only through the `option--active` class, and sees the closed control's focus only through the browser default outline. No stylesheet in the repository defines `option--active`, `option` or `size-picker`. Check that the stylesheet that will ship with this component gives `.option--active` a visible highlight and keeps a visible focus indicator on `[role=\"combobox\"]`, each with at least 3:1 contrast (WCAG 2.4.7 Focus Visible, 1.4.11 Non-text Contrast).",
